<title>BELGIUM: Belgian 2007 OLO sold at average 6.04 pct.</title>
<headline>Belgian 2007 OLO sold at average 6.04 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury gave the following details about the outcome of its monthly auction -</p>
<p>* 6.25 pct, March 2007 OLO</p>
<p>    Avg weighted price / yield   101.525 / 6.042 pct</p>
<p>    Price range of bids	    101.400 to 101.600</p>
<p>Stop (lowest accepted) price 101.500</p>
<p>    Percentage taken at stop     66.744</p>
<p>    Amount allotted		   12.015 billion francs</p>
<p>    Total amount of bids	    23.925 billion francs</p>
<p>* 5.00 pct, March 2001 OLO</p>
<p>    Avg weighted price / yield   101.038 / 4.709 pct</p>
<p>    Price range of bids	    100.900 to 101.050</p>
<p>Stop (lowest accepted) price 101.000</p>
<p>    Percentage taken at stop     29.931</p>
<p>    Amount allotted		    5.005 billion francs</p>
<p>    Total amount of bids	    10.325 billion francs</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
